 {"q": "Why does it matter that Revelation is addressed to seven real churches?", "options": ["Because it proves the apostle John wrote it", "Because any reading that makes it meaningless to its first readers is unlikely to be right", "Because there were only seven churches in the world", "Because the number seven predicts the date of the end"], "answer": 1, "why": "It is first a letter to people in the first century, about their situation; seven also stands for the whole Church."},
