 {"q": "What is the main difference between 1 Enoch 1 and Revelation 1?", "options": ["Enoch is about judgement and Revelation is not", "Enoch is written in the name of a hero of long ago; John writes in his own name, and his centre is a crucified man alive for ever", "Enoch was written after Revelation", "Revelation does not mention the coming of God"], "answer": 1, "why": "Enoch is pseudepigraphal and centres on God's coming; Revelation is signed by John and centres on Christ's death and life."},
